1:You were unconscious 3 days.. woke up below a pine tree.(You are one of the labourers ;) ) |The locals are loyal to you and for the dead king, but you have to prove to them you are a worthy one. Help to develop their village, lifestyle, teach them forging techniques, so they could make useful weapons against the tribes this province so they could defend themself in your absence.| 
2:There is secret Townhall where the king gathered tons of gold what you could use for build your leadership. Find it, but, take care, Tarian's groups hide nearby us and they are really well equipped. 
3:Goals: |1. Find the forgotten Townhall (ligh blue). |2. Destroy all main buildings in dark blue's villages.|3. Destroy the green-tribes.|Recommendation:-Follow the old pine trees planted by the King himself. I'm sure those will lead to the Townhall's place 
4:Our location got discovered by Tarian's headhunters, also they got free access across the plains..Prepare yourself for attacks.
5:The Tribes dislike that you brough conflict to their plain. Expect some unfriendly attacks.
